      {
        "source": "README.md:45",
        "text": "**I have a GPU**. Great, we can quickly train a baby GPT with the settings provided in the [config/train_shakespeare_char.py](config/train_shakespeare_char.py) config file:"
      },
      {
        "source": "README.md:51",
